<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>听雨轩 · 江南私房菜 — 杭州平海路老宅</title>
<meta name="description" content="听雨轩，杭州平海路临河老院里的江南私房菜，二十四席，四时菜单，订座专线 0571-8866 2048。">
<style>
  :root{--ink:#23282a;--ink-soft:#4d5659;--paper:#f6f2e9;--paper-2:#efe8da;--jade:#2f6b5c;--jade-dark:#214d42;--red:#9c3b2e;--gold2:#b08b45;--line:#ddd3c0;}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{font-family:"Songti SC","STSong","SimSun",serif;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.85;}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  svg{display:block;}
  .wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
  header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(246,242,233,.94);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:78px;}
  .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}
  .logo .mark{width:40px;height:40px;flex:none;}
  .logo .txt b{display:block;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:4px;line-height:1.2;}
  .logo .txt span{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-family:"Heiti SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;}
  nav ul{display:flex;gap:30px;list-style:none;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;}
  nav a{display:inline-block;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;}
  nav a:hover,nav a.on{color:var(--jade);border-bottom-color:var(--jade);}
  .nav-tel{font-family:"Heiti SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:var(--red);letter-spacing:1px;}

  .hero{position:relative;background:var(--paper-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);overflow:hidden;}
  .hero .inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;padding:70px 0 76px;}
  .hero h1{font-size:50px;letter-spacing:14px;font-weight:normal;line-height:1.4;}
  .hero .sub{font-family:"Heiti SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:7px;color:var(--gold2);margin-bottom:16px;}
  .hero p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:20px;font-size:15px;max-width:30em;}
  .btns{margin-top:30px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 30px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:3px;border:1px solid var(--jade);color:var(--jade);}
  .btn:hover{background:var(--jade);color:#fff;}
  .btn.solid{background:var(--jade);color:#fff;}
  .btn.solid:hover{background:var(--jade-dark);border-color:var(--jade-dark);}
  .heroart{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;padding:10px;}

  section{padding:66px 0;}
  .sec-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:44px;}
  .sec-head span{font-family:"Heiti SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:6px;color:var(--gold2);}
  .sec-head h2{font-size:32px;letter-spacing:8px;font-weight:normal;margin-top:8px;}
  .sec-head .rule{width:54px;height:1px;background:var(--gold2);margin:18px auto 0;}
  .band{background:var(--paper-2);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}

  .three{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:26px;}
  .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);}
  .card .pic{width:100%;height:170px;}
  .card .bd{padding:22px 24px 26px;}
  .card h3{font-size:21px;letter-spacing:4px;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .card .meta{font-family:"Heiti SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--red);margin-bottom:10px;}
  .card p{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-soft);}

  .two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:46px;align-items:center;}
  .two h3{font-size:28px;letter-spacing:7px;font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:18px;}
  .two p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:14px;}
  .quote{border-left:3px solid var(--gold2);padding-left:18px;color:var(--ink);font-size:17px;letter-spacing:2px;margin:22px 0;}

  .facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;text-align:center;}
  .fact b{display:block;font-size:34px;color:var(--jade);letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:normal;}
  .fact span{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-family:"Heiti SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;letter-spacing:2px;}

  .words{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;}
  .word{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px;}
  .word p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .word .who{margin-top:14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--gold2);font-family:"Heiti SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;letter-spacing:2px;}

  .cta{background:var(--jade);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:60px 0;}
  .cta h2{font-size:30px;letter-spacing:8px;font-weight:normal;}
  .cta p{margin-top:12px;opacity:.85;font-size:15px;}
  .cta .btn{border-color:#fff;color:#fff;margin-top:26px;}
  .cta .btn:hover{background:#fff;color:var(--jade);}

  footer{background:#23282a;color:#cfc9bd;padding:50px 0 24px;font-size:14px;}
  .fgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:30px;}
  footer h4{font-size:16px;letter-spacing:4px;font-weight:normal;color:#fff;margin-bottom:14px;}
  footer ul{list-style:none;}
  footer li{margin-bottom:8px;}
  footer a:hover{color:#fff;}
  .fbot{border-top:1px solid #39403f;margin-top:34px;padding-top:18px;font-size:12.5px;color:#8d8679;letter-spacing:1px;}

  @media(max-width:900px){
    .nav{height:auto;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;padding:14px 0;}
    .nav-tel{order:3;}
    nav ul{gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:14px;}
    .hero .inner,.two,.three,.words,.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .hero h1{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:8px;}
    .facts{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap nav">
    <a class="logo" href="index.html">
      <svg class="mark" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="听雨轩标识">
        <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="22" fill="none" stroke="#2f6b5c" stroke-width="1.6"/>
        <path d="M12 18h24M16 24h16M20 30h8" stroke="#b08b45" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <path d="M24 8v6M24 34v6" stroke="#9c3b2e" stroke-width="1.4"/>
      </svg>
      <span class="txt"><b>听雨轩</b><span>JIANGNAN  CUISINE</span></span>
    </a>
    <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a class="on" href="index.html">首页</a></li>
        <li><a href="menu.html">菜单</a></li>
        <li><a href="about.html">品牌故事</a></li>
        <li><a href="reserve.html">在线预订</a></li>
        <li><a href="contact.html">联系我们</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-tel">订座专线 0571-8866 2048</div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <div>
      <div class="sub">HANGZHOU · SINCE 1998</div>
      <h1>一院听雨<br>半席江南</h1>
      <p>二十六年来，我们守着平海路这座临河老宅，只做本帮与杭帮的家常滋味。食材按节气走，菜单一季一换，汤要吊足四个钟头，鱼在门口的活水缸里养着。</p>
      <div class="btns">
        <a class="btn solid" href="reserve.html">在线订座</a>
        <a class="btn" href="menu.html">查看四时菜单</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="heroart">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 520 380" role="img" aria-label="老宅院落插画">
        <rect width="520" height="380" fill="#f6f2e9"/>
        <path d="M0 300h520v80H0z" fill="#dfe4dc"/>
        <g stroke="#9fb2bd" stroke-width="2" fill="none"><path d="M0 330h520M30 350h460M60 366h400"/></g>
        <path d="M90 300V150h250v150z" fill="#fbf8f0" stroke="#c3b79c" stroke-width="2"/>
        <path d="M70 152l145-70 145 70z" fill="#5c6b66" stroke="#404c48" stroke-width="2"/>
        <path d="M70 152h290" stroke="#404c48" stroke-width="3"/>
        <rect x="130" y="190" width="60" height="60" fill="#eae2d2" stroke="#b08b45" stroke-width="2"/>
        <path d="M160 190v60M130 220h60" stroke="#b08b45" stroke-width="2"/>
        <rect x="240" y="190" width="60" height="110" fill="#9c3b2e"/>
        <path d="M270 190v110" stroke="#7d2e23" stroke-width="2"/>
        <circle cx="258" cy="248" r="3" fill="#e8c87a"/><circle cx="282" cy="248" r="3" fill="#e8c87a"/>
        <g stroke="#6f7f6d" stroke-width="3" fill="none">
          <path d="M420 300V190"/>
          <path d="M420 192c-22 6-36 24-40 48M420 192c24 10 36 28 36 52M420 230c-16 6-26 18-28 34M420 230c18 8 26 20 26 36"/>
        </g>
        <circle cx="392" cy="214" r="4" fill="#e0b24a"/><circle cx="452" cy="226" r="4" fill="#e0b24a"/>
        <circle cx="404" cy="258" r="4" fill="#e0b24a"/><circle cx="444" cy="268" r="4" fill="#e0b24a"/>
        <g stroke="#b9c7d0" stroke-width="1.6" opacity=".8">
          <path d="M40 40l-10 40M100 20l-10 40M160 44l-10 40M460 36l-10 40M500 70l-10 40"/>
        </g>
        <ellipse cx="215" cy="318" rx="70" ry="10" fill="#cdd6ce"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><span>SIGNATURE</span><h2>店里的招牌</h2><div class="rule"></div></div>
    <div class="three">
      <article class="card">
        <svg class="pic" viewBox="0 0 320 170" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img" aria-label="火踵蹄髈">
          <rect width="320" height="170" fill="#efe8da"/>
          <ellipse cx="160" cy="112" rx="96" ry="34" fill="#fbf8f0" stroke="#d6cbb4" stroke-width="2"/>
          <path d="M100 108c6-36 26-52 60-52s54 18 58 52z" fill="#a2502f"/>
          <path d="M112 100c8-24 24-34 48-34s42 12 48 34z" fill="#bf6a3d"/>
          <path d="M130 70c10 8 24 12 36 12" stroke="#f0d9b5" stroke-width="3" fill="none"/>
          <g fill="#3f6b45"><ellipse cx="88" cy="112" rx="14" ry="7"/><ellipse cx="232" cy="112" rx="14" ry="7"/></g>
        </svg>
        <div class="bd">
          <h3>火踵神仙鸭</h3>
          <div class="meta">镇店 · 需提前一日预留</div>
          <p>金华火腿脚圈与老鸭同炖六小时，不放一滴酱油，汤色清而味厚，肉一碰就脱骨。</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <svg class="pic" viewBox="0 0 320 170" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img" aria-label="西湖醋鱼">
          <rect width="320" height="170" fill="#e9eade"/>
          <ellipse cx="160" cy="110" rx="110" ry="36" fill="#fbf8f0" stroke="#d6cbb4" stroke-width="2"/>
          <path d="M70 104c34-30 120-30 160 0-40 28-126 28-160 0z" fill="#c9893f"/>
          <path d="M230 104l34-20v40z" fill="#b9762f"/>
          <circle cx="104" cy="100" r="4" fill="#3b3b3b"/>
          <path d="M120 96c20 10 60 10 86 0" stroke="#8a5a26" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
          <g stroke="#3f6b45" stroke-width="3" fill="none"><path d="M110 124c20 8 60 10 100 2"/></g>
        </svg>
        <div class="bd">
          <h3>西湖醋鱼</h3>
          <div class="meta">杭帮老味 · 现杀草鱼</div>
          <p>草鱼饿养两日去土腥，沸水汆三分钟，趁热浇镇江醋糖芡，入口先酸后甜，带一点蟹味。</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <svg class="pic" viewBox="0 0 320 170" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img" aria-label="龙井虾仁">
          <rect width="320" height="170" fill="#e4ebe3"/>
          <ellipse cx="160" cy="108" rx="92" ry="34" fill="#fbf8f0" stroke="#d6cbb4" stroke-width="2"/>
          <g fill="#f0a08a" stroke="#d9765c" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M128 96c10-12 28-10 30 4s-16 20-26 12z"/>
            <path d="M160 88c10-12 28-10 30 4s-16 20-26 12z"/>
            <path d="M144 112c10-12 28-10 30 4s-16 20-26 12z"/>
            <path d="M176 108c10-12 28-10 30 4s-16 20-26 12z"/>
          </g>
          <g stroke="#4c7a4a" stroke-width="2" fill="none"><path d="M124 118c6-6 12-8 18-6M196 92c6-6 12-8 18-6M152 128c6-6 12-8 18-6"/></g>
        </svg>
        <div class="bd">
          <h3>龙井虾仁</h3>
          <div class="meta">清明前后 · 时令限定</div>
          <p>河虾手工现剥，用明前龙井的头道茶汤点味，茶叶只取嫩芽，起锅前十秒下锅。</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap two">
    <div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 480 330" role="img" aria-label="灶间">
        <rect width="480" height="330" fill="#fbf8f0" stroke="#d6cbb4"/>
        <rect x="40" y="200" width="400" height="90" fill="#dcd2bd"/>
        <rect x="40" y="190" width="400" height="12" fill="#b9a885"/>
        <path d="M150 190c0-26 22-42 50-42s50 16 50 42z" fill="#5c6b66"/>
        <g stroke="#9c3b2e" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round">
          <path d="M186 146c-8-14 4-20 0-32 10 8 16 18 12 32M212 142c-8-18 6-26 2-40 12 10 18 24 14 40"/>
        </g>
        <rect x="300" y="150" width="110" height="40" fill="#eae2d2" stroke="#b9a885"/>
        <g stroke="#b08b45" stroke-width="2"><path d="M300 170h110"/></g>
        <g stroke="#6f7f6d" stroke-width="2" fill="none"><path d="M70 150v40M90 140v50M110 158v32"/></g>
        <circle cx="70" cy="146" r="7" fill="#9c3b2e"/><circle cx="90" cy="136" r="7" fill="#9c3b2e"/><circle cx="110" cy="154" r="7" fill="#9c3b2e"/>
        <rect x="40" y="290" width="400" height="10" fill="#c3b79c"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>灶上有人，火里有数</h3>
      <p>厨房只有六个人，掌勺的周师傅在这口灶前站了十九年。我们不用预制料包，不上中央厨房的半成品，高汤每天清早现吊，用老母鸡、火腿骨和干贝，撇沫三遍。</p>
      <p>菜单上大半的菜，都要看当天市场给什么。春天的螺蛳、夏天的莼菜、秋天的蟹、冬天的冬笋，过了时节就下架，不勉强。</p>
      <div class="quote">「不时不食，这四个字不是讲究，是本分。」</div>
      <a class="btn" href="about.html">读我们的故事</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="facts">
      <div class="fact"><b>1998</b><span>开业年份</span></div>
      <div class="fact"><b>24</b><span>堂内席位</span></div>
      <div class="fact"><b>3</b><span>独立包厢</span></div>
      <div class="fact"><b>6h</b><span>老汤慢炖</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><span>GUEST  BOOK</span><h2>客人留言</h2><div class="rule"></div></div>
    <div class="words">
      <div class="word">
        <p>带爸妈来吃的，老爷子说这个醋鱼是小时候的味道，酸得正，不腻。天井那桌挨着河，风一吹桂花落在桌上。</p>
        <div class="who">— 陈先生 · 本地食客</div>
      </div>
      <div class="word">
        <p>公司年末请客订了河畔厅，菜上得不紧不慢，服务员会报菜名讲做法。火踵神仙鸭一桌人抢着喝汤。</p>
        <div class="who">— 吴女士 · 商务宴请</div>
      </div>
      <div class="word">
        <p>出差路过，一个人坐在店堂角落点了两菜一汤，店家还送了一小碟糖桂花藕。吃完沿着河走了一段，很舒服。</p>
        <div class="who">— 林女士 · 外地旅客</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>今晚想吃点清淡的？</h2>
    <p>堂内二十四席，三间包厢。周末与节假日建议提前三日订座。</p>
    <a class="btn" href="reserve.html">立即预订座位</a>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap fgrid">
    <div>
      <h4>听雨轩 · 江南私房菜</h4>
      <p>杭州市上城区平海路老宅三十六号<br>临河老院，青砖黛瓦，二十四席。</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4>浏览</h4>
      <ul><li><a href="index.html">首页</a></li><li><a href="menu.html">菜单</a></li><li><a href="about.html">品牌故事</a></li></ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4>服务</h4>
      <ul><li><a href="reserve.html">在线预订</a></li><li><a href="reserve.html">包厢与宴席</a></li><li><a href="contact.html">交通指引</a></li></ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4>联络</h4>
      <ul><li>订座：0571-8866 2048</li><li>宴席：0571-8866 2049</li><li>每日 10:30 起接听</li></ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap fbot">© 2024 听雨轩餐饮 · 保留所有权利</div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
