<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>四时菜单 · 听雨轩</title>
<meta name="description" content="听雨轩四时菜单：冷碟、热炒、炖品、河鲜、时蔬、主食点心与宴席套餐。">
<style>
  :root{--ink:#23282a;--ink-soft:#4d5659;--paper:#f6f2e9;--paper-2:#efe8da;--jade:#2f6b5c;--jade-dark:#214d42;--red:#9c3b2e;--gold2:#b08b45;--line:#ddd3c0;}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{font-family:"Songti SC","STSong","SimSun",serif;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.85;}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
  svg{display:block;}
  .wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
  header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(246,242,233,.94);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:78px;}
  .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;}
  .logo .mark{width:40px;height:40px;flex:none;}
  .logo .txt b{display:block;font-size:21px;letter-spacing:4px;line-height:1.2;}
  .logo .txt span{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-family:"Heiti SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;}
  nav ul{display:flex;gap:30px;list-style:none;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;}
  nav a{display:inline-block;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;}
  nav a:hover,nav a.on{color:var(--jade);border-bottom-color:var(--jade);}
  .nav-tel{font-family:"Heiti SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:var(--red);letter-spacing:1px;}

  .page-top{background:var(--paper-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:56px 0 50px;text-align:center;}
  .page-top span{font-family:"Heiti SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:6px;color:var(--gold2);}
  .page-top h1{font-size:38px;letter-spacing:10px;font-weight:normal;margin-top:8px;}
  .page-top p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px;margin-top:12px;}
  .crumb{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-family:"Heiti SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;margin-top:16px;}
